# Caddy block for .46 — added to the real Caddyfile at ~/caddy/Caddyfile on
# <caddy-host> (<proxy-ip>), next to the other example.org services.
#
# Only the dashboard is proxied, and the dashboard is the only observability surface that
# exists: prometheus and jaeger run inside the aigw app's compose network with no ports
# published at all, so there is nothing else to reach. The Caddy -> Grafana hop stays on
# the home LAN; tailnet users additionally reach the dashboard via tailscale serve
# (README Step 5). Certs: DNS-01 via Cloudflare, like the rest of this domain.

# --- .132 gateway dashboard (ai-gateway-platform) ---
aigw.example.org {
    reverse_proxy <nas-ip>:3000
}
